sudhanix-welcome — first-login welcome panel, Sudhanix 26.

Design: 960x540 main window (sidebar + content), Customization and About
sub-dialogs. Spec: .claude/issues/04-welcome-panel-spec/

Behaviour preserved from v1:
  * DISPLAY/WAYLAND_DISPLAY gate — exit 0 if no display.
  * PAM token at /run/sudhanix-tokens/<uid>.tok with strict owner/mode check.
  * already_dismissed() — tri-state: True/False/None (LDAP read).
  * write_dismissal() — adds sudhanixUser objectClass if missing, sets flag.
  * Fail-soft: any LDAP/subprocess error logs to stderr, exits 0.
